 @viet0ne  honestly, those are true points but look at it this way: System Longevity.

Why buy an 8GB card now, when you save up for another month or so to get a 16GB card? yeah, the performance isn't better, but the system can remain as-is longer, there for presenting a better long-term value. a single pop of 350 bucks in a 5 year span is more effective than 2 rounds of 300.

